  RibonanzaNet   T3: n=  295  斜率 +0.15791  CI [0.08522, 0.22989]
  ViennaRNA      T0: n= 3806  斜率 +0.13342  CI [0.07211, 0.19207]
  ViennaRNA      T1: n=  136  斜率 +0.01300  CI [-0.0524, 0.06662]
  ViennaRNA      T2: n=   80  斜率 +0.09493  CI [0.01422, 0.17438]
  ViennaRNA      T3: n=  295  斜率 -0.02264  CI [-0.07632, 0.02002]
